      "en": "Then the LORD stretched out his hand and touched my mouth. Then the LORD said to me, “Behold, I have put my words in your mouth.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 그 손을 내밀어 내 입에 대시며 내게 이르시되 보라 내가 내 말을 네 입에 두었노라",
      "source_text_hash": "b6f683acf1a9873e1d8b305a24b411d357342eeb1395ebaf4a43a1351d45e6cc",
      "translation_text_hash": "091fc5b58438d7d9d73def10df20d1efd802a058d1c8c382db3bbd241ce85225",
