      "en": "Behold, I have today set you over the nations and over the kingdoms, to uproot and to tear down, to destroy and to overthrow, to build and to plant.”",
      "ko": "보라 내가 오늘날 너를 열방 만국 위에 세우고 너로 뽑으며 파괴하며 파멸하며 넘어뜨리며 건설하며 심게 하였느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "1807c48b9ca0cdb393e65047198166c55326193f55b6fde8e5b50a16ed5f28aa",
      "translation_text_hash": "e81b2b4f2f0eb909358723dadfb4d646637f395e2a8095469ef72350467999b0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
